#: invitedialog.cpp:78
msgid ""
"An invitation creates a one-time password that allows the receiver to "
"connect to your desktop.\n"
"It is valid for only one successful connection and will expire after an hour "
"if it has not been used. \n"
"When somebody connects to your computer a dialog will appear and ask you for "
"permission.\n"
" The connection will not be established before you accept it. In this dialog "
"you can also\n"
" restrict the other person to view your desktop only, without the ability to "
"move your\n"
" mouse pointer or press keys.\n"
"If you want to create a permanent password for Desktop Sharing, allow "
"'Uninvited Connections' \n"
"in the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Una invitación crea una contraseña d'un usu únicu que-y permitirá al "
"receutor coneutar al so escritoriu.\n"
"Ye válida namái pa una conexón y caducará nuna hora si nun s'usa. \n"
"Cuando daquién coneute col so equipu, aparecerá un cuadru que-y pidirá "
"permisu.\n"
" La conexón nun s'afitará enantes de que vusté l'apruebe. En talu diálogu "
"tamién\n"
" puede restrinxir a la otra persona pa que namái vea el so escritoriu ensin "
"poder\n"
" mover el mur o calcar tecles.\n"
"Si quier crear una contraseña permanente pa compartir el so escritoriu, "
"permita 'Conexones \n"
"non convidaes' na configuración."

